Download and install Unreal Engine 5.8.1 from Epic
Download ESMCompiler.zip
Unpack ESMCompiler.zip to wherever you want
Unpacked ESMCompiler.zip need to be put in Epic Games/UE_5.8/Engine/Plugins/Editor
Start Unreal Engine 5 and create new project
Open plugins (Window -> Plugins at the bottom of Window)
Seatch for ESMCompiler and add as your plugin
